{"id":"21aca82552a5a872","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-homogeneous-model.md","title":"Homogeneous Model","display":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homogeneous-model","aliases":["58-df-homogeneous-model"],"display":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homogeneous-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homogeneous-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homogeneous-model — Homogeneous Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66452054e74f936a\" href=\"?note=66452054e74f936a\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md\">../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md\">../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> (集合基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (部分初等映射谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66452054e74f936a\" href=\"?note=66452054e74f936a\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md\">../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S\\)</span> (自同构谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md\">../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homo}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{Homo}_\\kappa\\)</span> (compatibility notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\;\\forall f\\;\n\\left( |A|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,A,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak M)\n\\to\\exists g\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(g,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land g\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}A=f\\bigr)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)\\;\\forall f\\;\n\\left( |A|&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{PartialElementary}_{\\mathcal L}(f,A,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak M)\n\\to\\exists g\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(g,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land g\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}A=f\\bigr)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}model\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homo}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}model\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Homo}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{HomogeneousModel}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homogeneous models extend small partial elementary self-maps to automorphisms.</li>\n<li>该版本用书内已有的部分初等映射与自同构谓词表达强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-齐性，避免把无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tp}^{\\mathfrak M}\">\\(\\operatorname{tp}^{\\mathfrak M}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span> 当作原语。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"66452054e74f936a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-elementary-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943